    "title": "Vajont: The Dam Remained While the Reservoir Wave Destroyed the Valley",
    "dek": "The 1963 Vajont disaster is often compressed into the phrase “dam disaster.” The official record describes a different mechanism: a mountainside entered the reservoir, displaced the water and sent a wave over the dam into Longarone.",
