    "slug": "willow-island-construction-collapse",
    "title": "Willow Island: The Concrete Lift That Could Not Carry the Next Day",
    "dek": "Fifty-one workers died when a cooling tower under construction collapsed inward. The federal investigation traced the initiating failure not to the finished design, but to loads placed on concrete that had not gained enough strength.",
    "author": "Unassigned — AI-assisted editorial draft",
